//! Builder tests for work item 079, "World terrain readers".
//!
//! ORIGINAL evidence this file exercises (all outside Git, under `../lab`):
//! * `lab/extracted/client-assets/pack_*/**.gcnk` - the 2,344 preserved terrain chunks exported
